<h2 id=3D"other-resume-templates">Other Resume Templates</h2>
<p>There are other resume templates that are not great choices for a develo=
per or engineering manager resume for different reasons. We=E2=80=99ll look=
 at the ones that I=E2=80=99ve seen most frequently used by people:</p>
<ul>
<li>Google Docs: Serif resume template</li>
<li>Google Docs: Swiss resume template</li>
<li>Canva resume templates</li>
<li>Resume.io: software engineer template</li>
<li>Resume.io: web developer template with skill points</li>
<li>VisualCV: Standard template</li>
<li>EnhanCV: software engineer template</li>
<li>Europass CV</li>
</ul>
<p>Although I hesitate to recommend these templates, they could work well e=
nough when addressing their drawbacks, or for certain use cases. Don=E2=80=
=99t forget that the resume contents matter more than the template itself.<=
/p>
<p>Let=E2=80=99s review the templates, analyzing both the issues, as well a=
s their strengths.</p>
