top to bottom and they squeeze the space you can add for your experiences. =
However, if you go with one, the <a href=3D"http://pragmaticurl.com/resume-=
template-ttr-serif" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">Google Do=
cs Serif resume</a> is still an okay choice. It is not specific to software=
