<li>Add a =E2=80=9CTechnologies and Languages=E2=80=9D section or something=
 similar on the first page.</li>
<li>Make the summary short. You could also just drop the name =E2=80=9CSumm=
ary=E2=80=9D.</li>
<li>Drop the title =E2=80=9CSoftware Engineer=E2=80=9D. It=E2=80=99s obviou=
s and takes up space.</li>
<li>Consider jazzing up the headers and separators with colors.</li>
</ul></td><td><figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-c=
